$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of 1-(pentylcarbamoyl)-2-(benzyloxy)ethyl benzoate (20)
Following General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 15 (52 mg, 0.54
mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (70 mg, 0.57 mmol, 1.05 equiv),
aldehyde 6 (86 mg, 91 μL, 0.57 mmol, 1.05 equiv) and 20 mol % of catalyst
4 in CH2Cl2was stirred for 24 hrs. After removal of solvent followed by
silica gel chromatography, 20 (165 mg, 83%) was obtained as a
yellowish-white solid. Data for 20: 1H NMR: (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.08 (dd,
J = 1.2, 8.0 Hz, 2H, aryl); 7.64-7.60 (m, 2H, aryl); 7.51-7.47 (t, J =
8.0 Hz, 4H, aryl); 7.30-7.27 (m, 2H, aryl); 6.24 (bt, 1H, NH); 5.60 (t, J
= 3.2 Hz, 1H, CH2); 4.58 (s, 2H, CH); 4.04-4.0 (dd, J = 5.2, 11.2 Hz, 1H,
CH2); 3.95-3.91 (dd, J = 3.6, 11.2 Hz, 1H, CH2); 3.33-3.26 (m, 2H, CH2);
1.54-1.47 (q, J = 7.2 Hz, 2H, CH2); 1.33-1.23 (m, 4H, CH2); 0.83 (t, J =
6.8 Hz, 3H, CH3) 13C NMR: (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 167.9, 165.5, 138.9, 133.9,
130.1, 129.5, 128.9, 128.6, 128.0, 127.8, 73.8, 73.6, 69.6, 39.6, 29.4,
29.2, 22.5, 14.2 IR: (neat) νmax = 2930, 2860, 1726, 1663, 1540, 1452,
1267, 1097, 712 cm-1 TLC: Rf = 0.34 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2) HRMS: EIMS calculated
for C22H27NO4+ [M+ H]+: 370.2019, found: 370.2013 HPLC: (+/−)-20 tR28.2
min (49.8%); tR 30.5 min (50.2 %) (+)-20 tR 27.4 min (94.7%); tR 31.2 min
(5.3%) (Diacel Chiralcel OJ 0.46 cm φ x 25 cm, Gradient; t0 0% IPA in
Hexane, t10min 2% IPA in Hexane, t20min 4% IPA in Hexane, t30min 6% IPA
in Hexane, 1 mL/min) OR: [α]D22= + 22.1° (CHCl3, c = 4.74)
