$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of (butylcarba moyl)(furan-2-yl)methyl benzoate (26) Following
General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 14 (39mg, 41 μL, 0.47 mmol,
1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (60 mg, 0.49 mmol, 1.05 equiv) and aldehyde
10 (47 mg, 41 μL, 0.49 mmol, 1.05 equiv) in CH2Cl2 was stirred for 48
hrs. After removal of solvent and silica gel chromatography, 26 (116 mg,
82%) was obtained as a brownish solid. Data for 26: 1H NMR: (400 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 8.08-8.05 (dd, J= 0.8, 4.4 Hz, 2H, aryl); 7.59-7.55 (m, 1H,
aryl); 7.45-7.41 (m, 3H, aryl); 6.56 (d, J= 4.0 Hz, 1H, aryl); 6.47-6.45
(bm, 1H, NH); 6.44 (s, 1H, CH); 6.36 (dd, J= 1.2, J= 3.2, 1H, aryl);
3.38-3.28 (q, J= 6.0 Hz, 2H, CH2); 1.54-1.47 (q, J= 7.6 Hz, 2H, CH2);
1.36-1.29 (sext, J = 7.6 Hz, 2H, CH2); 0.89 (t, J= 7.2 Hz, 3H, CH3) 13C
NMR: (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 166.4, 165.1, 148.4, 143.8, 133.9, 130.1, 129.2,
128.8, 111.6, 110.9, 69.5, 39.6, 31.7, 20.2, 13.9 IR: (neat) νmax = 3297,
2958, 1725, 1668, 1557, 1265, 1243, 1107, 707 cm-1 TLC: Rf = 0.41
(EtOAc:Hex 1:2) HRMS: EIMS calculated for C17H19NO4+ [M+ H]+: 302.1393,
found: 302.1356 HPLC: (+/−)-26 tR 21.9 min (52.2%); tR 27.9 min (47.8 %)
(−)-26 tR 22.7 min (10.9%); tR29.2 min (89.2%) (Diacel Chiralcel OD 0.46
cm φ x 25 cm, 5% IPA in Hexane, 1 mL/min; isocratic) OR: [α]D22 = -8.7°
(CHCl3, c = 0.91)
