$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of (pentylcarbamoyl)(furan-2-yl)methyl benzoate (27) Following
General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 15 (44 mg, 57 μL, 0.45
mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (58 mg, 0.47 mmol, 1.05 equiv) and
aldehyde 10 (45 mg, 39 μL, 0.47 mmol, 1.05 equiv) in CH2Cl2 was stirred
for 48 hrs. After removal of solvent and silica gel chromatography, 27
(116 mg, 82%) was obtained as a whitish-brown solid. Data for 27: 1H NMR:
(400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.09-8.06 (m, 2H, aryl); 7.62-7.57 (m, 1H, aryl);
7.48-7.42 (m, 3H, aryl); 6.57 (d, J= 3.2 Hz, 1H, aryl); 6.45 (s, 1H, CH);
6.38 (dd, J= 2.0, 3.6 Hz, 1H, aryl); 6.30 (bs, 1H, NH); 3.39-3.29 (sept,
J= 7.2 Hz, 2H, CH2); 1.58-1.50 (quin, J= 7.2 Hz, 2H, CH2); 1.34-1.24 (m,
4H, CH2); 0.86 (t, J= 6.8 Hz, 3H, CH3) 13C NMR: (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 166.2,
165.0, 148.3, 143.8, 134.0, 130.1, 129.2, 128.8, 111.7, 110.9, 69.5,
39.8, 29.3, 29.1, 22.5, 14.2 IR: (neat) νmax = 2932, 1726, 1665, 1452,
1265, 710 cm-1 TLC: Rf = 0.47 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2) LRMS: EIMS calculated for
C18H21NO4+ [M+ H]+: 316.1, found: 316.2 HPLC: (+/−)-27 tR 15.0 min
(53.1%); tR 19.8 min (46.9 %) (−)-27 tR 15.4 min (11.2%); tR 20.8 min
(88.8%) (Diacel Chiralcel OD 0.46 cm φ x 25 cm, 5% IPA in Hexane, 1
mL/min; isocratic) OR: [α]D22 = -37.3° (CHCl3, c = 1.54)
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, molecular sieves used in second stage, molecular sieves
used in third stage, Passerini reaction
