$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Ugi product 12k. According to General Procedure I, reaction between
alkylated DHP-2-one 11 (100 mg, 0.22 mmol), acetone13, benzylamine (36
μl, 0.33 mmol) and propionic acid (18 μl, 0.24 mmol) in MeOH (400 μl)
afforded after 165 h. 12k (114 mg, 0.17 mmol, 77%) as a white foam.
Column chromatography was performed with c-hexane/EtOAc 8:2→ 7:3 12k,
yield (114 mg, 0.17 mmol, 77%) 1H NMR (250 MHz, CDCl3): δ (ppm) 7.70-7.66
(m, 3H), 7.48-7.44 (m, 2H), 7.35-7.17 (m, 14H), 7.00-6.96 (m, 2H), 5.61
(d, J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 5.26 (d, J= 7.1 Hz, 1H), 4.55 (d, JAB = 18.1 Hz, 1H),
4.44 (d, JAB = 18.1 Hz, 1H), 4.18 (d, JAB = 17.0 Hz, 1H), 3.82 (d, JAB =
17.0 Hz, 1H), 2.36-2.05 (m, 2H), 1.40 (s, 9H), 1.11 (s, 3H), 1.04 (t, J=
7.3 Hz, 3H), 0.91 (s, 3H); 13C NMR (63 MHz, CDCl3): δ (ppm) 174.3 (C),
172.4 (C), 170.7 (C), 167.2 (C), 139.3 (C), 138.7 (C), 138.0 (C), 137.8
(C), 134.7 (C), 129.4 (2 CH), 128.7 (2 CH), 128.6 (CH), 128.4 (2 CH),
128.3 (2 CH), 127.8 (3 CH), 127.6 (2 CH), 127.4 (2 CH), 127.2 (CH), 127.0
(CH), 125.9 (2 CH), 112.8 (CH), 81.8 (C), 63.1 (C), 62.8 (C), 47.8 (CH2),
47.4 (CH2), 43.0 (CH), 27.9 (3 CH3), 27.7 (CH2), 25.0 (CH3), 23.5 (CH3),
9.5 (CH3); IR (neat): 3403 (w), 2982 (w), 1744 (m), 1661 (s), 1493 (m),
1447 (w), 1383 (m), 1368 (m), 1227 (m), 1204 (w), 1153 (s), 961 (w), 754
(s), 698 (s), 588 (w); HRMS (FAB): calculated for C43H48N3O5 (MH+)
686.3588, found 686.3592.
